
~ start

Heca: You need to give up something in order to pass to the next level. What do you want to sacrifice?
- Knowledge [#icon=knowledge]
	do sac_knowledge()
	Now, all your knowledge is lost. Click anywhere to exit...
	do _finished()
- Health [#icon=health]
	do sac_health()
	Now, your health is reduced. Click anywhere to exit...
	do _finished() 
=> END	